  "lesson": {
    "instructions": "Use i (index) on G, m (middle) on B and a (ring) on high E. Count 1, 2-and, 3-and: hold the first pluck for one beat, then play four eighth notes. Use p (thumb) for the written bass. Pluck bass and G together on beat 1, then B, high E, B, G. Keep the same right-hand pattern. Use partial G and open D. Play G twice, D twice and return to G twice. Take a full rest bar and repeat. Slow down or practise the static parts until the change feels comfortable.",
